WEBVTT

NOTE Unofficial English translation of the Thai narration. If it differs from the Thai original documents, the Thai original prevails.

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:06.317
The Senate Committee on Military
Affairs and State Security, chaired

00:00:06.317 --> 00:00:10.459
by Mr. Somboon Nunual, has
called Meeting No. 32/2569.

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:15.180
The committee chair ordered this meeting
to be called as an urgent matter.

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:22.120
Tuesday, 24 November 2026, at 2.30 p.m.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:26.140
Meeting room 301, 3rd
floor, Parliament House.

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:30.800
The committee's three subcommittees
are chaired as follows.

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:35.220
Military Affairs:
Asst. Prof. Nifarid Raden Ahmad.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:42.679
Cyber, Technology, Weapons and Defence
Industry: Mr. Chaiyong Maneerungskul.

00:00:42.759 --> 00:00:46.940
And Holistic Security:
Mr. Thanatpong Wongmulalee.

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:51.386
According to the meeting notice,
the agenda has four items.

00:00:51.466 --> 00:00:54.526
Item 1: announcements by the chair.

00:00:54.606 --> 00:00:59.880
Item 2: adoption of the minutes of
Meetings No. 30/2569 and 31/2569.

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:02.899
Item 3: five matters for consideration.

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:07.080
And Item 4: other matters
and the next meeting date.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:11.912
First: a framework for
studying how to resolve

00:01:11.912 --> 00:01:15.578
the unrest in the southern
border provinces,

00:01:15.659 --> 00:01:18.871
to raise the quality of development
in every dimension, holistically.

00:01:18.951 --> 00:01:24.000
The meeting notice gives only the
title and does not name any invitees.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:28.078
Second: the work of the subcommittees.

00:01:28.158 --> 00:01:32.359
Following up on matters
assigned by the committee,

00:01:32.439 --> 00:01:36.460
reports on their work, and
requests for approval to proceed.

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:43.985
Third: a report on the study visit
to follow up on recovery, remedies

00:01:43.985 --> 00:01:49.658
and relief from the unrest in
the southern border provinces,

00:01:49.739 --> 00:01:55.340
held on 30–31 October 2026 in
Songkhla and Pattani provinces.

00:01:56.340 --> 00:02:00.860
Fourth: the draft report
on the committee's

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:04.118
work for fiscal year B.E. 2569,

00:02:04.199 --> 00:02:09.058
covering October 2025 to September 2026.

00:02:09.138 --> 00:02:14.031
And fifth: appointing
additional honorary advisers

00:02:14.031 --> 00:02:18.239
to the committee for
fiscal year B.E. 2570.

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:23.280
This information comes from the
committee's meeting notice.

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:25.500
The schedule may change.

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:28.072
Meeting results will be
available through the

00:02:28.072 --> 00:02:30.398
channels of the
Secretariat of the Senate.

